{"id":"613938","name":"莲藕猪肉水饺","author":"Magic叮咚","authorId":"11490259","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/613938/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莲藕","amount":"1节"},{"name":"猪肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"面团","amount":"1份"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"和好一份饺子面团饧发备用。","img":"images/613938/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"葱姜切碎。","img":"images/613938/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉馅里放入葱花姜末等调料。","img":"images/613938/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"烧适量花生油晾凉备用。","img":"images/613938/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"莲藕去皮擦丝。","img":"images/613938/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再用刀切碎。","img":"images/613938/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"撒盐去水。","img":"images/613938/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"藕丝出水后攥干。","img":"images/613938/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入晾凉的熟花生油拌匀。","img":"images/613938/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"和肉馅混合均匀。","img":"images/613938/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"调好馅料。","img":"images/613938/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取适量面团揉成长条，切成均匀的面剂子。","img":"images/613938/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"擀出饺子皮。","img":"images/613938/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"取适量馅料按扁捏拢即可。","img":"images/613938/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"水开后下入饺子，煮至熟透。","img":"images/613938/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"调点蒜泥调料，开吃了。","img":"images/613938/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}